- [Create a cache report](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/filegateway/latest/files3/create-cache-report.md): Generate a report of the file metadata currently cached by an S3 File Gateway.
- [Manage cache reports](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/filegateway/latest/files3/manage-cache-reports.md): View, check status, or delete cache reports for a specific file share associated with your S3 File Gateway.
